[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2728359235","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104251#issuecomment-2728359235","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104251","id":2728359235,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6in3VD","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T06:39:46Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T10:30:33Z","body":"Feels really convenient, I like it.\r\nSome suggestings:\r\n- rename `alignment` to `relative_offset`.\r\n- change `relative_offset` step from 0.1 to 0.01 or 0.001.\r\n- make `centered` property use/change `relative_offset`, so you don't have to tweak `relative_offset` range when `centered` changes. Please note that this suggestion needs more discussion.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2728359235/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730003501","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104251#issuecomment-2730003501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104251","id":2730003501,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iuIwt","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T15:43:06Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T20:53:10Z","body":"Thanks for the review!\r\n\r\n> - rename `alignment` to `relative_offset`.\r\n\r\nThat probably is a better name. I'm not entirely sold on it because there's another property called just `offset` without any qualifier like \"constant\" or \"fixed\". It adds some ambiguity when referring to it, and `relative_offset` seems at first glance like it should be the same thing as `offset` (an offset is by its nature always relative to something after all).\r\n\r\nFor now I'll wait and see if any other reviewers have an opinion before changing the name.  \r\n\r\n\r\n> - change `relative_offset` step from 0.1 to 0.01 or 0.001.\r\n\r\nMakes sense, I think that's the steps commonly used elsewhere? I only picked 0.1 because it makes it a bit easier to hit the middle value with the slider (most of the time I'd expect only -0.5, 0 and 0.5 to be used anyway).\r\n\r\nEdit: Updated  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n> - make `centered` property use/change `relative_offset`, so you don't have to tweak `relative_offset` range when `centered` changes. Please note that this suggestion needs more discussion.\r\n\r\nI don't think this is a good idea. That would mean that clicking the centered checkbox visually does nothing, which would be confusing and unintuitive, and deviates from the current behaviour of `centered`.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2730003501/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3386180290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104251#issuecomment-3386180290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104251","id":3386180290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J1QLC","user":{"login":"pdfrod","id":227799,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzc5OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227799?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod","html_url":"https://github.com/pdfrod","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T14:36:21Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T14:36:21Z","body":"Hello! I was looking forward for this feature, but the pull request was closed without any comments. Is there an explanation for closing this?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3386180290/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387347739","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104251#issuecomment-3387347739","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104251","id":3387347739,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7J5tMb","user":{"login":"Nallebeorn","id":7013489,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMTM0ODk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7013489?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn","html_url":"https://github.com/Nallebeorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nallebeorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T20:11:52Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T20:11:52Z","body":"> Hello! I was looking forward for this feature, but the pull request was closed without any comments. Is there an explanation for closing this?\r\n\r\nHi, sorry for the silent close! I never documented it in this thread, but I actually discussed this PR a little bit in the contributors chat not too long after I opened it ([link](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/2d?msg=2XEedhqgxxBmN6r4f)). Bottom line is 2D maintainers were pretty iffy about it because of not wanting to add more complexity to the sprite offsets, and because it can be worked around pretty easily. And honestly, I think that is quite fair and when I revisited it now I concluded in not really interested in championing this solution :)\r\n\r\nGodot has *a lot* of more-or-less stale PRs far older than this, but I personally prefer closing mine over leaving it open when unlikely to ever be merged. If there turns out to be more support than expected for this solution, it can always be reopened or salvaged.\r\n\r\nI'm not closing the original proposal as I still think *something* like this or https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/93538 would be an improvement. But as long as we're stuck with the old `centered` flag, it's hard to solve it without either breaking compatibility or adding some redundant complexity.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3387347739/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3397049850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104251#issuecomment-3397049850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104251","id":3397049850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ket36","user":{"login":"pdfrod","id":227799,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNzc5OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/227799?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod","html_url":"https://github.com/pdfrod","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pdfrod/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-13T11:10:08Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T11:10:08Z","body":"That's too bad; I though this would be a very nice addition. But anyway, thanks a lot for the explanation!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3397049850/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]